From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 08:34:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] perf(i18n): merge en fallback at build time, one locale
 chunk

The i18n loader always fetched English plus the target locale at runtime
so missing keys could fall back - every non-English page loaded two chunks
(e.g. en 137KB + zh 134KB). Add a vite 'locale-merge' plugin that resolves
@locales/<locale> to a virtual module already merged with English at build
time. Runtime now loads exactly one chunk per locale (-~136KB raw / ~20KB
wire for zh users).
